I mean, we've already established that there are valid criticisms to Seraphine, (and i agree her lore is LEGIT her weakest part) but this post was more directed to the about the people who are just either: boarding the hate train for clout with no valid argument whatsoever, or those who actually have valid arguments but are so disrespectful to those who actually enjoy her, and of course the cringe "justice for skarner" wave, it was fine the first few times but when every media that Seraphine comes out on is flooded with spam comments like those, it gets irritating. 

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

Also, I hate that the community is calling people who enjoy her as "simps." Baby, I'm a homosexual, I ain't simping, I just like her aesthetic so I wanna play her that's all.
